"""fig4_sdq_composite_stats  -  Group comparison of the SDQ composites between the two response splits (both-up vs any-down pattern; AMPA up vs AMPA down)

Computes
    Group comparison of the SDQ composites between the two response splits
    (both-up vs any-down pattern; AMPA up vs AMPA down).

Inputs
    04_figures/fig.4/fig4_data/fig4_subject_level_n288.csv  (staged read-only into the scratch mirror)
    04_figures/fig.4/fig4_data/fig4_sdq_items_n287.csv  (staged read-only into the scratch mirror)
    04_figures/fig.4/fig4_data  (staged read-only into the scratch mirror)

Output
    $FIG4_OUT/figures/fig.4/fig4_data/fig4_sdq_composite_stats.csv  (default $FIG4_OUT = 03_analysis/fig4/_scratch)
    reference copy: 04_figures/fig.4/fig4_data/fig4_sdq_composite_stats.csv

Statistical tests
    Welch two-sample t test, Mann-Whitney U, Hedges' g, covariate-adjusted OLS
    group term (sex, site, FD) and Benjamini-Hochberg FDR across the composites.

Cohort
    n = 287.

Runs on a laptop
    yes - seconds on a laptop.

seed
    no random component

Rebuilt from execution-log cell
    a9666212-e3ef-41f3-8ac3-b4d157a1e8b1 (frame fe47a03f-2d43-4fe0-a1c3-e0544839d822, 2026-09-21 16:23:19 UTC, conda env python, exit ok)
    verbatim archive: recovered/fig4/fig4_sdq_composite_stats__cell_a9666212.py
"""
